   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Nastya has realised she is the one who broke Barinov's mirror, and now two people are fighting over it. She takes Kostya aside to tell him, but Kostya is thinking about something else. Listen to their talk in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Костя, мне надо тебе кое-что сказать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Я поступила неправильно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
