   "t": " means 'regarding' and is common in speech.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Я не об этом.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That's not what I'm talking about.' Russian says 'I not about this', with no action word. It is a good phrase for steering a conversation back.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Это я разбила зеркало Виктору Петровичу.",
