  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "И теперь они из-за меня ссорятся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And now they are fighting because of me.' Now let's break down the dialogue: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
