  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is 'nothing to oneself', and nobody can say why it means 'wow', but it does. It's a good one to say when you are surprised.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "И что теперь делать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And what do we do now?' Russian says 'what to do', with no 'we' and no 'should'. The basic form of the action carries all of it.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Стало быть, насчет вечера всё в силе?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
